    fix(embeddings): resolve mapped namespaces against the duckbrain root (GAP-063b)
    
    namespaceMappings values are written relative to the duckbrain root
    (namespaces/<ns>) but resolveNamespacePath resolved them against the
    namespaces dir, producing <root>/namespaces/namespaces/<ns> and
    'Namespace not found' for every mapped namespace (coding-hermes,
    hermes-memory, infra all failed on embeddings status/migrate/rebuild).
    Unmapped names still resolve against the namespaces dir.
    
    Also export resolveNamespacePath + add a regression test (mapped value
    must resolve to <tmp-root>/namespaces/<ns>).
    
    ch:trace row=GAP-063b spec=src/cli/embeddings.ts::resolveNamespacePath test=src/cli/embeddings.test.ts::GAP-063b evidence=live:duckbrain-embeddings-status-coding-hermes witness=live:embeddings-cli-error-output
    
    Co-authored-by: Alexis Okuwa <wojonstech@gmail.com>
